@startuml state_payment
title Increment 8 - Simulated Payment Transaction States
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : attempt created (attemptId)
Pending --> Successful : simulated gateway approves
Pending --> Failed : simulated gateway declines
Successful --> Reversed : booking not confirmed\n(expired hold / commit failed)
Successful --> Refunded : policy-eligible refund
Successful --> NeedsReconciliation : reversal or refund result unknown
NeedsReconciliation --> Reversed : resolved
NeedsReconciliation --> Refunded : resolved
Failed --> [*]
Reversed --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Failed
  Booking stays Pending and
  retry is allowed until the
  original hold deadline.
end note
@enduml